{
 "n": 7,
 "title": "How the defense adjusts in 40 seconds without knowing the play",
 "html": "<p><strong>Short answer:</strong> the defense never knows the play. It reacts to what it can see (personnel, formation, down and distance), and every defender plays by a set of rules that tell him what to do no matter which play is coming.</p>\n<p><strong>The 40 seconds between plays, in order:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 326\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Timeline of the 40 seconds between plays, showing when the defense substitutes, gets its call, aligns and adjusts\"><defs><marker id=\"m17w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m17y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"46\" x2=\"46\" y1=\"24\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,.5)\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"28.0\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">40s</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"97.0\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">30s</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"166.0\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">20s</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"235.0\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">10s</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"304.0\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">0s</text><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"24.0\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"28.0\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Play ends. 40-second clock starts.</text><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"51.6\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"55.6\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Offense sends in its personnel.</text><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"72.3\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"76.3\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#F2B705\">Defense subs to match: base, nickel or dime.</text><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"106.8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"110.8\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#F2B705\">Coach radios the call to one defender, who tells the rest.</text><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"189.6\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"193.6\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#F2B705\">Offense lines up. Defense aligns to the strong side.</text><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"244.8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"248.8\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#F2B705\">Motion or shift: defense makes a \"check.\"</text><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"300.0\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"304.0\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Snap. Each defender reads his key: run or pass?</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"318\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#F2B705\">Yellow = the defense adjusting</text></svg></div>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Substitution.</strong> The offense sends in its personnel (Lesson 1). If it substitutes, the rules give the defense a chance to substitute too, so the defense swaps into base, nickel or dime (Lesson 2).</li>\n<li><strong>The call.</strong> The defensive coordinator picks a play from a sheet organized by situation: down, distance, field position, score. He radios it to one player whose helmet has a speaker, usually a linebacker (in the NFL, his helmet has a green dot on the back), who tells everyone else.</li>\n<li><strong>Alignment.</strong> The offense lines up. The defense sets its linemen and linebackers toward the formation's \"strong side\" (the side with the TE or more receivers), using rules like \"our best run stopper lines up across from the tight end.\"</li>\n<li><strong>Checks.</strong> If the offense shifts or sends a player in motion, defenders adjust with pre-planned \"checks\": a one-word call that changes who covers whom. They practice these all week against the formations that opponent likes.</li>\n<li><strong>Snap.</strong> Now each defender reads a \"key,\" one player whose first step tells him run or pass. A linebacker watches the guard in front of him: guard fires forward = run, guard steps back = pass.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>So yes, yardage drives a lot of it.</strong> Same defense, two situations:</p>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 262\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Third and one: heavy offense against a base defense with eight in the box\"><defs><marker id=\"m18w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m18y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"106\" y=\"84\" width=\"214\" height=\"62\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.10)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"150\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"163\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"191\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"191\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"219\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"219\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"247\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"247\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"103.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"96\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"99.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"100\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"103.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"127.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"127.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"110\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"113.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"40\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"43.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"166\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"169.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"286\" cy=\"166\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"169.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"164\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"167.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"164\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"167.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"186\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"189.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"230\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"233.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"22\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">3rd & 1: base defense, safety walks down, 8 in the box</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"252\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Offense in 12 personnel: 2 TEs to block for a run</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\">Expecting a run: extra bodies packed near the line (the dashed \"box\").</p><div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 232\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Third and ten: dime defense with pass rushers charging straight at the quarterback\"><defs><marker id=\"m19w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m19y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"150\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"163\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"191\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"191\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"219\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"219\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"247\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"247\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"96\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"99.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"127.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"127.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"114\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"117.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">NB</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"110\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"113.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DB</text><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"44\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"47.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><circle cx=\"276\" cy=\"44\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"276\" y=\"47.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"286\" cy=\"166\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"169.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"164\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"167.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"170\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"173.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"164\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"167.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"212\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"215.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"234\" cy=\"212\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"234\" y=\"215.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><path d=\"M163 146 L181.0 196\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#m19y)\"/><path d=\"M191 146 L195.0 196\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#m19y)\"/><path d=\"M219 146 L209.0 196\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#m19y)\"/><path d=\"M247 146 L223.0 196\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#m19y)\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">3rd & 10: dime, 6 DBs to cover receivers</text><text x=\"246\" y=\"208\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#F2B705\">rushers sprint straight</text><text x=\"246\" y=\"221\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#F2B705\">at the QB, ignoring the run</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\">Expecting a pass: extra DBs to cover, rushers ignore the run.</p>\n<p>3rd and 1 gets a heavy box full of run stoppers; 3rd and 10 gets dime and extra rushers. But a good offense uses that against the defense, which is why play-action passes work best when the defense is sure a run is coming.</p>\n<p><strong>How to spot it on TV:</strong> watch the defense right as the offense breaks its huddle. You'll see players pointing and shouting. That's the checks being made. Motion right before the snap often causes a last-second scramble.</p>",
